WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.547
Bring one corner to the opposite corner.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:09.549
Line up both edges, then press the diagonal crease flat.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.283
Open the sheet.

00:00:18.283 --> 00:00:23.073
Bring the other pair of corners together, then press the diagonal crease flat.

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:41.204
Open the sheet, then bring one straight edge to the opposite edge.

00:00:41.204 --> 00:00:43.449
Press the fold into a rectangle.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:02.467
Open the sheet, turn the fold a quarter turn, and fold edge to edge.

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.978
Press the crease, then open it flat.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:16.093
Bring each corner point into the center.

00:01:16.093 --> 00:01:20.499
Keep the four points together, then press every triangular flap flat.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.618
Flip it over.

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:04.165
Bring each corner to the center again.

00:02:04.165 --> 00:02:08.262
Keep all four points together, then press the smaller square flat.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.223
Fold the small square in half and press the crease.

00:02:42.223 --> 00:02:45.734
Open it, turn it, and repeat in the other direction.

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:01.981
Slide your fingers under the four loose flaps.

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:06.130
Push the pockets toward the center until the fortune teller opens.
